    <string name="telos_shizuku_howto_title">How to start</string>
    <string name="telos_shizuku_howto_body">Root: tap Start with root.\nWireless: enable pairing accessibility, tap Pair wirelessly, then Developer options → Wireless debugging → Pair device with pairing code. Telos reads the 6-digit code and opens a popup (and a notification) so you can confirm it while the Settings dialog is still open.\nComputer: USB debugging on, then run the adb command below.</string>
    <string name="telos_shizuku_pair_prompt_body">Type the 6-digit code from the Wireless debugging dialog. Leave that dialog open until pairing finishes.</string>
